     1	//! `set_action_end`'s END patch door, moved whole out of `edit_action.rs`
     2	//! (road map "creator-jobs" CO2a1's toll, a pure move): [`check_end_patch`],
     3	//! the walk of an end patch's three groups; [`not_a_target`], the keys an
     4	//! action may not animate; [`prune_removed`], a `null`'s removal from the
     5	//! stored end; and `off` (spec §11 CI-14) — [`check_off`] reading its paths
     6	//! and [`key_off`] writing each one's `null`. `edit_action.rs` composes them
     7	//! in `set_action_end`; `END_PATCH` is also `edit_action_graphic.rs`'s.
